WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.040
Preserving the pitch was the most interesting thing to

2
00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:04.740
build.

3
00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:07.430
On YouTube, if you slow a song down,

4
00:00:07.430 --> 00:00:10.140
the voice sounds like slow motion.

5
00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:13.730
Here you can choose to keep it sounding the same,

6
00:00:13.730 --> 00:00:17.360
at the same pace as the beat.

7
00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:21.260
There are also effects like echo and next room,

8
00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:25.740
which you can combine so the music sounds like you're at

9
00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:29.230
a concert, or in a concert's parking lot,

10
00:00:29.230 --> 00:00:33.420
or hearing the party your neighbor is throwing next

11
00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:35.280
door.

12
00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:38.060
And if you put on headphones and close your eyes,

13
00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:41.390
it really takes you there.

14
00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:46.380
Here is a quick sample of how Duckity sounds playing

15
00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:48.178
with the app's effects.
